# Signal value input

When building or changing any UI that **selects a signal and collects a value**, follow [signals.md](../skills/fuel-engineering/signals.md).

**Reuse** `apps/web/src/lib/signals/group-catalog.ts`:

- `manualObservationValuePlaceholder(signal)` — never hardcode `e.g. 2.4M` for all signals
- `parseManualObservationValue(signal, raw)` — gate submit on `.valid`
- Branch controls on `kind`: qualitative text · boolean select · quantitative by `unit`

**Validation:** USD may use `$`/`K`/`M`/`B`. Units like `months`, `pct`, `days`, `count` accept **plain numbers only** — no letters (`12m` must not become millions).

**Checklist:** kind-aware control + placeholder · reset value on signal change · `canSubmit` uses parse validity · inline error with `t.negative` when invalid.

**Reference UIs:** `LogIntelligenceDrawer.tsx`, initiative drawer log form in `InitiativesTab.tsx`.
